  "solution": {
    "text": "Differentiating both sides, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>p</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>q</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>s</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />Putting&nbsp;<math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get,&nbsp;<math><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn